      "created_at": "2013-04-24T17:59:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm going to make the following guesses, numbering the ships 1-10 from the left:</p><p>Human: 4, 8</p><p>Sulph-Orc: 3, 10</p><p>Neo-Elf: 5, 9</p><p>Electro-Dwarf: 2, 6</p><p>Spectre: 1, 7</p><p>I think the elf ships are the svelte ones that look like daggers, the dwarf ships are the blocky ones, and the spectre ships are the organic ones. &nbsp;For the humans, we already know about the Folly, and #8 looks like a modular spacestation design (very Terran). &nbsp;For the orcs, we know about the Claw, and #10 was the only one left, although I wouldn't normally think that was an orc design.</p><p>Any counter-guesses?</p><p><a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/9EccQop.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The ships</a>.</p>",
